# Comments

Follow [language](../recommendations/comments/language.md), [sections](../recommendations/comments/sections.md), [docstrings](../recommendations/comments/docstrings.md), and [react](../recommendations/comments/react.md).

Russian comments are allowed. Split a file that has more than one responsibility.

## File and class markers

```python
# --> Data class
class DotComData:
    pass

# --> Main class
class DotCom:
    # -> Class setup
    def __init__(self) -> None:
        pass

    # -> Util funcs
    @staticmethod
    def calc_func(arg: int) -> int:
        return arg
```

## Class and method text

```python
class DotCom:
    """Usage dots for the dotcom website."""

    def plus_sub(self, arg: int) -> int:
        """Return the argument plus 4."""
        arg += dotcom.main_argument  # Read the main argument from the util class
        return arg + 4
```

## TypeScript markers

```tsx
// --> Product card
export function ProductCard({ product }: ProductCardProps) {
  // -> Price display
  const priceLabel = formatPrice(product.price);
  return <article>{priceLabel}</article>;
}
```
